        // the ice (the part mirrors whatever tree holds one of the board's shadow slots 1 to 23 at that moment: drive, below, deals the slots), the chip-birds' feathered edge. The aureole (cMoonE) is not touched: it stays the night's honey. Snow, halo, sky and lit faces are the dusk law's above, untouched.
        const kp = smoothstep(U_EXIT, U_NEAR, u), k = WOOD_SHARE * kp;
